{{!
    @template local_servicemanager/chips_rows

    The rows of a list of names that a dialogue shows: what the script draws again each time the search narrows the list.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * items - The names, each as an object with a name

    Example context (json):
    {
        "items": [{"name": "moodle/user:viewdetails"}, {"name": "moodle/course:view"}]
    }
}}
{{#items}}
    <li class="list-group-item"><span class="sm-fn">{{name}}</span></li>
{{/items}}
